SAY~Blackguard~
SAY~Blackguard~
SAY~BLACKGUARD: The Blackguard epitomizes evil. Consorting with demons and devils and serving dark deities, The blackguard is hated and feared by all. The Blackguard has many options available to him - sending forth dark minions and servants to do his bidding, attacking with stealth and honorless guile, or straightforward smiting of the forces of good that stand in his way.


Advantages:
- Smite good: Once per day per five levels Blackguard may attempt to smite a good aligned enemy with one normal melee attack. If he manages to hit, then the target dies (no save)
- Dark Blessing: Blackguard recieves +2 bonus to all saving throws 
- Contagion: The experienced Blackguard can use Contagion as a spell-like ability (1/day)
- Inflict Serious Wounds: Blackguard can use Inflict serious wounds at level 11
- Inflict Critical wounds: Blackguard can use Inflict Critical Wounds as a spell-like ability at level 12 (1/day)
- Create Undead: At level 10 Blackguard can attempt to summon an Undead ally as a servant (1/day)
- Bull's Strength: At level 8 Blackguard may use Bull's Strength as a spell-like ability (1/day)
- Summon Fiend: At level 20 Blackguard may attempt to summon a very powerful demon from the lower planes

Disadvantages: none~

