SAY NAME1~Bracers~
SAY NAME2~Paladin's Bracers~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC~Bracers are thick bands of metal or leather that are strapped, belted, or tied to a character's forearm.~
SAY DESC~Defenders of justice are ever eager to acquire another tool which may be used to thwart the machinations of evil.  However, these particular gauntlets can only be worn by a warrior of the purest heart.

STATISTICS:
