SAY NAME1~Bracers~
SAY NAME2~Blessed Bracers~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC~Bracers are thick bands of metal or leather that are strapped, belted, or tied to a character's forearm.~
SAY DESC~The willing sacrifice of a vast fortune in gold, combined with the holy venerations of the sanctifying ceremony, have convinced the blessed powers to transform these already formidable gauntlets into gloves of awesome righteous power. 

