COPY~Rylorn\Items\malice00.itm~ ~override\malice00.itm~
SAY NAME1~Unholy Malice~
SAY NAME2~Unholy Malice~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC~This sword was once belonged to a long forgotten god, whose naime is also forgotten. What is known however is the fact that this sword is a formidable weapon. It bears such a hatred to all living things that will actually open the portal between Negative Energy plane and any other plane the Unfortunate victim is currently in and drain the life force until the creature is completely sucked out of life essence. Any Magical protections are pointless against this sword, as it will steadfastly dispel any magical effects placed upon a creature. It also bears magical resistance of it's own, so magical attacks will also prove useless. Only people of the most black of hearts may even dare to equip this weapon.

STATISTICS:
EQUIPPED ABILITIES:
25% Magic Resistance
Dispel Magic whenever the sword strikes an opponent
50% chance that the enemy will be drained 1 level whenever the sword strikes an opponent
THAC0 +5 bonus
Damage: 1D12 +5
Damage Type: Slashing
Weight:7
Speed:5
Proficiency Type:Two Handed Sword
Type: Two Handed
Only Usable by:
Blackguard~

