COPY~Rylorn\Items\nordomcr.itm~ ~override\nordomcr.itm~
SAY NAME1~NORDOM'S CROSSBOWS~
SAY NAME2~NORDOM'S CROSSBOWS~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC~Nordom's home plane of Mechanus is driven by great clockwork gears. Tending these gears and making sure they run smoothly are given to creatures called "gear spirits."  These gear spirits have the ability to turn themselves into almost any tool or common mechanical device... even crossbows. Nordom's two crossbows are actually two gear spirits, and they seem to have willingly fled with him from Mechanus. Their duties are so essential to the smooth functioning of Mechanus that the modrons have officially assigned these spirits to the various gears. While the gear spirits love the gears they tend so much, their servitude to the modrons rankles them, making them somewhat disgruntled. As a result, there are tales of gear spirits that leave the great gears of Mechanus, leaving their duties for a while to sample the Planes beyond their own. Most likely, Nordom's two crossbows caught this wanderlust, and they now piggyback along with him, peppering any hostile creature they see with crossbow bolts. The gear spirits can make endless supplies of these bolts, so there is never any need for Nordom to reload unless he wishes to fire new crossbow bolts. The crossbows occasionally make small clicking and rattling noises. They seem to be talking to each other, but their conversation is indecipherable. They're most likely discussing the finer points of crossbow mechanics.

STATISTICS:
Damage: Varies According to Ammo
Enchanted: +1
THAC0: +1
Speed: 10
Weight: 7
Requires no ammo
Proficiency: Crossbow~
COPY~Rylorn\Items\phantom0.itm~ ~override\phantom0.itm~
SAY NAME1~Phantom Dagger~
SAY NAME2~Phantom Dagger~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC~As if of its own volition, this dagger seems to reach out to its enemies, instinctively finding the most vulnerable spots on any creature..

STATISTICS:
