Weight: 1
Proficiency: Dagger
Not usable by Priests~
COPY~Rylorn\Items\ravelfin.itm~ ~override\ravelfin.itm~
SAY NAME1~Ravel's Fingernail~
SAY NAME2~Ravel's Fingernail~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC~This twisted fingernail of extruded night hag skin has got to be one of the ugliest things you have ever seen. Its mottled green, red, and black surface is almost a foot long, and it seems like it was used alternately as a scratching aid, nose-picking tool, and gardening trowel. Looking at it makes you wish that Ravel did chew her nails. Or at least had a nail file with her in the maze.

STATISTICS:
(Unique, Artifact)
Damage: 2-7 Piercing
Enchanted: +2
Special: 2-12 Poison Damage
THAC0: +2
Speed: 1
Weight: 1
Proficiency: Dagger
Not usable by Priests~
COPY~Rylorn\Items\ryring00.itm~ ~override\ryring00.itm~
SAY NAME1~Rylorn's Ring~
SAY NAME2~Rylorn's Ring~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC~This ring offers some protection against the attacks, natural and magical alike. This ring was given to Rylorn by his superiors in the Temple of Dark Sun.

STATISTICS:
AC +1
+1 to all saving throws
Immunity to fear and morale failure

Only Usable by: Rylorn~
COPY~Rylorn\Items\salieru0.itm~ ~override\salieru0.itm~
SAY NAME1~Tear of Salieru-Dei~
SAY NAME2~Tear of Salieru-Dei~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC~This glistening red tear was shed by the martyred Harmonium officer Salieru-Dei when he was put to death on the Harmonium's home plane of Ortho. Mistaken as a member of the hated Revolutionary League, Salieru-Dei's obedience and loyalty was such he could not bring himself to challenge the allegations of his superiors. At the moment of his execution, three tears fell from his right eye and turned to stone as they fell upon the flagstones of the square. Ironically enough, an anarchist subsequently revealed the Harmonium's mistake to the public, discrediting them. Ever since, the tears of Salieru-Dei have been considered relics of the Harmonium... and used as a lesson to the evils of unquestioning obedience by the Revolutionary League.

STATISTICS:
(Artifact)
Special: Permanent +1 Constitution
Weight: 0
Usable only by Lawful Good Characters~
COPY~Rylorn\Items\sw1h64.itm~ ~override\sw1h64.itm~
SAY NAME1~Bastard Sword~
SAY NAME2~Purifier +4~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC~Also known as the hand-and-a-half sword, the bastard sword derives its name from the fact that it is halfway between the two-handed sword and the long sword. The bastard sword has a double-edged blade and a long grip, which can accommodate both hands if preferred.  The overall length of the bastard sword ranges between four feet and four feet ten inches.   

STATISTICS:

Damage:  2D4 
Damage type:  slashing
Weight: 10
Speed Factor: 8
Proficiency Type: Bastard Sword
Type:  1-handed
Requires: 11 Strength
Not Usable By:
 Druid
 Cleric
 Mage
 Thief~
SAY DESC~This single handed weapon is infused with the very essence of virtue, and is rumored to be the sanctified blade of the famous paladin Sir Wediyer.  The weapon was lost when Sir Wediyer pursued a fleeing pit fiend through a planar rift.  Neither the fiend nor Sir Wediyer ever returned.

STATISTICS

Equipped Abilities: 
    20% Magic Resistance
Combat Abilities: 
    Additional +4 damage versus chaotic evil opponents
    
THACO:  +4 bonus
Damage:  2D4 + 4
Damage type:  slashing
Weight:  6
Speed Factor: 4
Proficiency Type: Bastard Sword
Type:  1-handed
Requires: 11 Strength
Usable By:
Paladins~
