SAY NAME1~Dragon Manual~
SAY NAME2~Dragon Manual~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC~This Manual describes the process of Summoning the Black Dragon, the most unruly inhabitant of wastelands. If summoned properly the Dragon will obey the Caster until slain or summoning period expired.

STATISTICS:
Summon Black Dragon
Book will vanish after use
Only usable by: Mages(Single,Dual & Multi-Class)
Sorcerer~
